## Production environment — baked into bundle during `vite build`
## This file is committed to git and overrides .env for production builds.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.verdaxis.exchange/api

## Behavioral analytics collector (Umami, self-hosted; website id is public).
## Enabled 2026-07-15 with the Product Analytics workspace promotion --
## bounded-enum events only, no identifiers (see docs/product-analytics-runbook.md).
VITE_ANALYTICS_HOST=https://api.verdaxis.exchange
VITE_ANALYTICS_WEBSITE_ID=287f8836-0b4e-4c2c-836a-13392f3676c0
